 <section class="inner-section light-section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kicker">Buyer selection guide</p><h2>Choose by application, not only by material.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="automotive-wire-harness-tape-selection-guide.html">Open the selection guide <span>↗</span></a></div><p style="max-width:820px;color:#526167;font-size:16px">For an effective technical review, prepare the harness location, operating temperature, abrasion or noise requirement, flame-retardancy requirement, tape width and roll length. The guide explains which questions help narrow the initial product route.</p></section>
