+<main>
+  <section class="page-hero dark-section"><p class="kicker">Battery protection / Partner-produced</p><h1>Battery Protection Materials for Cell and Pack Manufacturing</h1><p>REALS supplies electrical insulation and flame-retardant tape materials for defined locations inside battery cells and packs. These products are produced by our qualified manufacturing partners to REALS specification. We manage specification definition, technical documentation and delivery coordination, giving battery manufacturers and pack integrators a clear route from drawing review to an approved, repeatable supply program.</p><div class="crumbs"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="products.html">Products</a><span>/</span><b>Battery Protection</b></div></section>
+
+  <section class="inner-section light-section" id="insulation"><div class="line-heading"><p class="kicker">Product category 01</p><h2>Electrical Insulation Tapes</h2><p>Materials for insulation, separation, wrapping and protection at drawing-defined locations within cell and pack assemblies.</p></div><div class="battery-product-grid">
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Cell and pack insulation</p><h3>PET Blue Film Tape</h3><p>For insulation and identification at drawing-defined cell and pack locations.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Localized insulation</p><h3>PI (Polyimide) Tape</h3><p>For localized electrical insulation at positions identified in the assembly drawing.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Cell finishing</p><h3>Termination Tape</h3><p>For securing and insulating defined termination areas in cell manufacturing.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Tab area protection</p><h3>Tab Tape</h3><p>For insulation and protection around drawing-defined battery tab locations.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Layer separation</p><h3>PET Insulating Film</h3><p>For electrical separation and surface protection within cell or pack assemblies.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+  </div></section>
+
+  <section class="inner-section light-section" id="flame" style="padding-top:0"><div class="line-heading"><p class="kicker">Product category 02</p><h2>Flame-Retardant Tapes</h2><p>Partner-produced tape constructions for drawing-defined wrapping, shielding and protective locations in battery pack assemblies.</p></div><div class="battery-product-grid">
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Pack wrapping</p><h3>Flame-Retardant PET Fabric Tape</h3><p>For wrapping and protection at specified cable, module or pack locations.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Structural protection</p><h3>Fiberglass Cloth Tape</h3><p>For reinforcement and protection at drawing-defined assembly locations.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Shielding layer</p><h3>Aluminum Foil Fiberglass Tape</h3><p>For protective shielding at designated pack and component interfaces.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+    <article class="battery-product-card"><p class="kicker">Surface protection</p><h3>Flame-Retardant Acrylic Tape</h3><p>For bonding or protection at application locations defined by the customer drawing.</p><p class="spec-note">Specifications to be confirmed to your drawing</p></article>
+  </div></section>
+
+  <section class="inner-section light-section"><div class="line-heading"><p class="kicker">Technical documentation</p><h2>What we can share</h2><p>Documentation is matched to the confirmed product and available scope from the manufacturing partner.</p></div><div class="document-grid"><article><h3>Material data sheets</h3><p>Product information aligned with the specification under review.</p></article><article><h3>Dimensional drawings</h3><p>Drawing-based dimensions for customer confirmation before approval.</p></article><article><h3>Available test reports</h3><p>Relevant reports available from our manufacturing partner for the confirmed material.</p></article></div></section>
+
+  <section class="inner-section dark-section"><div class="line-heading"><p class="kicker">Drawing-to-production workflow</p><h2>How we work</h2></div><div class="workflow-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Send drawing</h3><p>Share the application position, drawing and documentation needs.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Confirm specification</h3><p>We align the material route and required deliverables with you.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Sample and approval</h3><p>Samples are prepared for your evaluation and formal approval.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Production</h3><p>Approved materials move to coordinated partner production and delivery.</p></article></div></section>
+
+  <section class="cta dark-section"><div class="cta-inner reveal"><p class="kicker">Start a technical review</p><h2>Have a battery component drawing?</h2><p>Tell us the application location and documentation you require. We will review the request with the appropriate qualified manufacturing partner.</p><div><a class="btn" href="contact.html">Send your drawing or specification</a></div></div></section>
+
+  <section class="inner-section light-section"><div class="line-heading"><p class="kicker">Frequently asked questions</p><h2>Battery protection sourcing</h2></div><div class="faq-grid"><article><h3>Who produces these materials?</h3><p>They are produced by our qualified manufacturing partners to REALS specification.</p></article><article><h3>Can you work from our drawing?</h3><p>Yes. Send the drawing and application location for specification review.</p></article><article><h3>Are samples available?</h3><p>Samples can be arranged after the specification is confirmed.</p></article><article><h3>What documents can you share?</h3><p>Material data sheets, dimensional drawings and available test reports from our manufacturing partner.</p></article><article><h3>Do you claim a specific certification or performance level?</h3><p>No unverified claim is made. Applicable documentation is reviewed against the confirmed specification.</p></article></div></section>
